                                        <property name="can-focus">True</property>
                                        <property name="receives-default">False</property>
                                        <property name="draw-indicator">True</property>
                                        <property name="tooltip-text" translatable="yes">Unchecked (default): only the current frame is exported (a single, rigid receptor). Checked: every frame in the range below is exported as its own receptor snapshot -- e.g. several conformations from an MD trajectory, each docked independently and reported separately (this is what "flexible receptor" means in this tool: an ENSEMBLE of rigid snapshots, not AutoDock's own per-residue flexible sidechains).</property>
